msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/proficiencyAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "proficiencyAgent is functional"
msgstr "proficiencyAgent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/proficiencyAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proficiencyAgent is functional: a language-proficiency relator expresses the proficiency of exactly one agent, the identity-constituting party whose command of the language the reified proficiency is about."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proficiencyAgent 是函数性的:一个语言能力关系元恰好表达一个主体的能力——该被具体化的能力所关乎的、构成其身份的对语言掌握程度的那一方。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/proficiencyLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "proficiencyLanguage is functional"
msgstr "proficiencyLanguage 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/proficiencyLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proficiencyLanguage is functional: a language-proficiency relator concerns exactly one language, the constitutive subject the reified proficiency is a proficiency in."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proficiencyLanguage 是函数性的:一个语言能力关系元恰好关乎一种语言——该被具体化的能力所属的构成性主题。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/proficiencyLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "proficiencyLevel is functional"
msgstr "proficiencyLevel 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/proficiencyLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proficiencyLevel is functional: a language-proficiency relator records exactly one attained level, the single gmeow:ProficiencyLevel value (such as cefrB2 or levelNative) it has reached."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proficiencyLevel 是函数性的:一个语言能力关系元恰好记录一个已达到的等级——其所达到的唯一 gmeow:ProficiencyLevel 值(如 cefrB2 或 levelNative)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/proficiencyModalityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "proficiencyModality is functional"
msgstr "proficiencyModality 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/proficiencyModalityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proficiencyModality is functional: a language-proficiency relator rates exactly one skill modality, since a distinct proficiency is minted per (agent, language, modality) so that per-skill levels coexist rather than crowding one relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proficiencyModality 是函数性的:一个语言能力关系元恰好评定一种技能模态,因为每个(主体、语言、模态)三元组都会创建一个独立的能力实例,从而使各技能等级并存,而不是挤在同一个关系元上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/proficiencyScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "proficiencyScale is functional"
msgstr "proficiencyScale 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/proficiencyScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proficiencyScale is functional: a language-proficiency relator measures its level on exactly one framework, the single gmeow:ProficiencyScale (CEFR, ILR, ACTFL, or self-reported) against which the attained level is read."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proficiencyScale 是函数性的:一个语言能力关系元恰好依据一个框架衡量其等级——据以解读所达到等级的唯一 gmeow:ProficiencyScale(CEFR、ILR、ACTFL 或自我报告)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/stateLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "stateLanguage is functional"
msgstr "stateLanguage 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/stateLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:stateLanguage is functional: a LanguageState relator describes the state of exactly one subject language, variety, or version — the single language whose status the reified claim is about."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:stateLanguage 是函数性的:一个 LanguageState 关系体恰好描述一种主体语言、变体或版本的状态——即该具化断言所关乎其状态的那唯一一种语言。"

